"Backup erased" = "Cadangan dihapus";
"The backup and PIN are gone from this card. The next backup on it will ask you to set a new PIN." = "Cadangan dan PIN telah dihapus dari kartu ini. Cadangan berikutnya di kartu ini akan meminta Anda mengatur PIN baru.";
"The backup is gone from this card. Its PIN stays the same." = "Cadangan telah dihapus dari kartu ini. PIN-nya tetap sama.";
